      "date": "2026-04-29T11:09:08.000Z",
      "title": "NAUKRI: Upcoming Board Investments And Subsidiary Moves Will Support Future Upside Potential",
      "body": "Info Edge (India)'s analyst fair value estimate has shifted slightly from ₹1,415.95 to ₹1,392.20 as analysts fine tune assumptions around the discount rate, revenue growth, profit margins and future P/E expectations. What's in the News A board meeting is scheduled on Feb 13, 2026 at 10:00 Indian Standard Time to consider and approve unaudited standalone and consolidated financial results for the quarter and nine months ended Dec 31, 2025, to consider a proposal to declare a second interim dividend, and to review amendments to the company's dividend distribution policy (Key Developments).",
      "keyDevTypeId": null,
      "source_url": "https://simplywall.st/community/narratives/in/media/nse-naukri/info-edge-india-shares/sk6cj6hz-expanding-into-indias-secondary-markets-and-ai-will-fuel-success-cdh3/updates/20-info-edge-indias-analyst-fair-value-estimate-has-shifted",
      "raw_subtype": "narrative-update"
    },
    {
      "id": "af82221c-1a41-4910-82d4-f5dea4387a9b",
      "type": "narrative-update",
      "date": "2026-04-14T16:05:57.000Z",
      "title": "NAUKRI: Upcoming Board Investments And Subsidiary Transfers Will Support Future Upside Potential",
      "body": "Analysts have slightly reduced their price target on Info Edge (India) to ₹1,415.95 from about ₹1,435.24. The adjustment reflects updated views on the discount rate, revenue growth, profit margin and future P/E assumptions, rather than a major shift in outlook.",
      "keyDevTypeId": null,
      "source_url": "https://simplywall.st/community/narratives/in/media/nse-naukri/info-edge-india-shares/sk6cj6hz-expanding-into-indias-secondary-markets-and-ai-will-fuel-success-cdh3/updates/19-analysts-have-slightly-reduced-their-price-target-on-info-ed",
      "raw_subtype": "narrative-update"
    },
    {
      "id": "047843fd-e6ae-4e9a-9011-5d026794386f",
      "type": "narrative-update",
      "date": "2026-03-31T15:08:46.000Z",
      "title": "NAUKRI: Upcoming Board Deals And Subsidiary Moves Will Drive Upside Potential",
